        ":question/problem": "Which of the following are vector fields on ${R}^{3}?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $T(x,y,z)=\\operatorname{sin}\u2061x\\,i-\\operatorname{cos}\u2061y\\,j+{z}^{2}\\,k$\n- **II.** $U(t)=2t\\,i-{t}^{2}\\,j-\\sqrt{t}\\,k$\n- **III.** $V(x,y,z)={e}^{-2z}\\sqrt{x+y}$",
