        ":question/problem": "Which of the following are vector fields on ${R}^{3}?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $D(x,y,z)=5\\,i+{z}^{2}\\,j+(y+x)\\,k$\n- **II.** $E(x,y)={x}^{2}\\,i-\\sqrt{y}\\,j$\n- **III.** $G(x,y,z)=x(y+1)\\,i+\\operatorname{tan}\u2061(y-z)\\,j+{z}^{3}\\,k$",
