        ":question/problem": "Which of the following are vector fields on ${R}^{3}?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $C(x,y,z)=\\frac{z}{x+y}$\n- **II.** $D(x,y)=\u27e8{y}^{3}-3,\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(2x-y),7{x}^{3}\u27e9$\n- **III.** $E(x,y,z)=\u27e8\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(x+z),\\operatorname{tan}\u2061z,\\frac{1}{x-y}\u27e9$",
